(1856, 'componentfield', 'updated', 'App\\Models\\ComponentField', 'updated', 453, 'App\\Models\\User', 1, '{\"attributes\":{\"value\":\"                    <p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\">\\u200b<br><\\/span><\\/p><h3 style=\\\"line-height: 2rem\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 32px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"><strong>Project Overview<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/h3><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\">The City Center Tower is a landmark commercial building in the heart of Dhaka. RAR Lift was chosen to provide a comprehensive vertical mobility solution that could handle high traffic volumes while maintaining energy efficiency and passenger comfort.<\\/span><\\/p><h3 style=\\\"line-height: 2rem\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 36px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"><strong>The Challenge<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/h3><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\">The primary challenge was installing high-speed elevators in a tightly constrained shaft space while minimizing disruption to the ongoing construction of the surrounding floors.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-04-06T11:19:21.000000Z\"},\"old\":{\"value\":\"                <p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\">\\u200b<br><\\/span><\\/p><h3 style=\\\"line-height: 2rem\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 32px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"><strong>Project Overview<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/h3><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\">The City Center Tower is a landmark commercial building in the heart of Dhaka. RAR Lift was chosen to provide a comprehensive vertical mobility solution that could handle high traffic volumes while maintaining energy efficiency and passenger comfort.<\\/span><\\/p><h3 style=\\\"line-height: 2rem\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 36px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"><strong>The Challenge<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/h3><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\">The primary challenge was installing high-speed elevators in a tightly constrained shaft space while minimizing disruption to the ongoing cons