(2031, 'componentfield', 'updated', 'App\\Models\\ComponentField', 'updated', 799, 'App\\Models\\User', 1, '{\"attributes\":{\"value\":\"                            Project Overview\\n<p>The Meridian Sky Plaza is a landmark 24-story corporate tower located in the commercial heart of Agrabad, Chattogram. Designed as a \\\"Grade A\\\" office space, the building required a high-traffic vertical transportation solution that reflected the prestige of its multinational tenants while providing the smoothest ride quality available in the market.<\\/p>\\n\\nThe Challenge\\n<p>The primary challenge was managing the heavy morning and lunch-hour surges typical of a financial district. The developer also requested a \\\"showpiece\\\" glass elevator on the exterior that could withstand the high humidity and coastal winds of the Chattogram port area without compromising on safety or speed.<\\/p>\\n\\nOur Solution\\n<p>We installed a synchronized system of 6 high-performance elevators specifically engineered for durability and efficiency. Our team focused on a hybrid approach to solve both the aesthetic and logistical needs of the tower:<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Architectural Focus:<\\/strong> We installed two Panoramic Elevators with custom curved-glass cabins, providing a breathtaking view of the Bay of Bengal while maintaining whisper-quiet operation.<\\/li>\\n<li><strong>Intelligent Logistics:<\\/strong> To handle peak traffic, we implemented a Destination Control System (DCS), which groups passengers by floor and has successfully reduced average waiting times by 40%.<\\/li>\\n<li><strong>Mechanical Excellence:<\\/strong> Using Mitsubishi\\u2019s PM Motor technology, we achieved a vibration-free experience so smooth that a coin can stand on its edge during full-speed travel.<\\/li>\\n<li><strong>Industrial Strength:<\\/strong> A heavy-duty Service Elevator was integrated with reinforced flooring and widened doors to handle office furniture and maintenance equipment without affecting the executive passenger flow.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-04-08T10:04:44.000000Z\"},\"old\":{\"value\":\"                        Project Overview\\n<p>The Meridian Sky Plaza is a landmark 24-story corporate tower located in the commercial heart of Agrabad, Chattogram. Designed as a \\\"Grade A\\\" office space, the building required a high-traffic vertical transportation solution that reflected the prestige of its multinational tenants while providing the smoothest ride quality available in the market.<\\/p>\\n\\nThe Challenge\\n<p>The primary challenge was managing the heavy morning and lunch-hour surges typical of a financial district. The developer also requested a \\\"showpiece\\\" glass elevator on the exterior that could withstand the high humidity and coastal winds of the Chattogram port area without compromising on safety or speed.<\\/p>\\n\\nOur Solution\\n<p>We installed a synchronized system of 6 high-performance elevators specifically engineered for durability and efficiency. Our team focused on a hybrid approach to solve both the aesthetic and logistical needs of the tower:<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Architectural Focus:<\\/strong> We installed two Panoramic Elevators with custom curved-glass cabins, providing a breathtaking view of the Bay of Bengal while maintaining whisper-quiet operation.<\\/li>\\n<li><strong>Intelligent Logistics:<\\/strong> To handle peak traffic, we implemented a Destination Control System (DCS), which groups passengers by floor and has successfully reduced average waiting times by 40%.<\\/li>\\n<li><strong>Mechanical Excellence:<\\/strong> Using Mitsubishi\\u2019s PM Motor technology, we achieved a vibration-free experience so smooth that a coin can stand on its edge during full-speed travel.<\\/li>\\n<li><strong>Industrial Strength:<\\/strong> A heavy-duty Service Elevator was integrated with reinforced flooring and widened doors to handle office furniture and maintenance equipment without affecting the executive passenger flow.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-04-04T12:18:58.000000Z\"}}', NULL, '2026-04-08 10:04:44', '2026-04-08 10:04:44'),
