(6276, 'page', 'updated', 'App\\Models\\Page', 'updated', 16, 'App\\Models\\User', 1, '{\"attributes\":{\"name\":\"Contact\",\"permalink\":\"contact\",\"description\":\"<p><br><\\/p><p>Contact<\\/p><h1 style=\\\"line-height: 1.1\\\">Book a consultation with our team<\\/h1><p style=\\\"line-height: 1.75rem\\\">Call, message on WhatsApp, or send the consultation form below. A consultant will confirm a time and tell you what to prepare.<\\/p>\",\"page_text_content\":\"<p><br><\\/p>\",\"status\":\"1\",\"is_breadcrumb\":1,\"seo_index\":\"noindex\",\"header_component\":\"header\",\"header_component_position\":\"fix\",\"footer_component\":\"footer\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-07T12:14:16.000000Z\"},\"old\":{\"name\":\"\",\"permalink\":\"\",\"description\":null,\"page_text_content\":null,\"status\":\"3\",\"is_breadcrumb\":0,\"seo_index\":null,\"header_component\":null,\"header_component_position\":null,\"footer_component\":null,\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-07T12:13:10.000000Z\"}}', NULL, '2026-10-07 12:14:16', '2026-10-07 12:14:16'),
(6277, 'componentmaster', 'created', 'App\\Models\\ComponentMaster', 'created', 52, 'App\\Models\\User', 1, '{\"attributes\":{\"id\":52,\"name\":\"contact-up-faq\",\"set_from\":\"custom\",\"database\":null,\"relational_table\":null,\"related_data\":null,\"default_relationship_config\":null,\"default_advanced_relationship_config\":null,\"is_single\":true,\"is_connected\":false,\"data_source_component_id\":null,\"data_source_fields_mode\":\"all\",\"data_source_selected_fields\":null,\"limit\":null,\"position\":40,\"schema_group_settings\":{\"1\":{\"name\":\"Section Section Label: Who this is for Section Title: Students, sponsors and families at any stage Section Description: Whether your deadline is weeks or a year away, the starting point is the same: an honest assessment of where the financial position stands today. Card Instance 1 Title: Students with an offer in hand Description: You have an admission or conditional offer and need the financial evidence organised before the visa application window opens. Icon: graduation-cap Instance 2 Title: Parents and family sponsors Description: You are funding the study and need your income, assets and source of funds documented in a form an assessing officer can verify. Icon: users Instance 3 Title: Self-employed and business sponsors Description: Your income comes from a business, so trade licences, company records, filed returns and accounts must reconcile with your bank activity. Icon: briefcase Instance 4 Title: Families planning ahead Description: Your intake is a year away and you want to know now what to hold, where, for how long, and what documentation to start building. Icon: building-2 <section class=\\\"bg-navy py-16 sm:py-24\\\"><div class=\\\"mx-auto w-full max-w-content px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 xl:px-12\\\"><div class=\\\"grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16\\\"><div class=\\\"lg:col-span-5\\\"><div class=\\\"max-w-2xl\\\"><p class=\\\"mb-3 text-[13px] font-semibold text-gold-light\\\">Why it matters<\\/p><h2 class=\\\"text-balance font-display font-bold text-[29px] sm:text-[38px] lg:text-[42px] text-white\\\">Why proper financial documentation matters<\\/h2><p class=\\\"mt-4 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-white\\/75\\\">Applications are rarely refused because a family cannot afford the course. They are questioned because the paperwork does not explain the money clearly.<\\/p><\\/div><a class=\\\"inline-flex min-w-0 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg text-center font-medium transition-[background-color,color,border-color,box-shadow,transform] duration-200 ease-out focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-brand-blue disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-60 bg-gold text-navy-deep hover:bg-[#B8944B] shadow-card min-h-14 px-6 py-3 text-base sm:px-7 mt-8\\\" href=\\\"\\/contact\\\">Start with an assessment<svg xmlns=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.w3.org\\/2000\\/svg\\\" width=\\\"18\\\" height=\\\"18\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><path d=\\\"M5 12h14\\\"><\\/path><path d=\\\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\\\"><\\/path><\\/svg><\\/a><\\/div><ul class=\\\"lg:col-span-7\\\"><li class=\\\"flex gap-5 border-b border-white\\/10 py-7 first:pt-0 last:border-0 last:pb-0\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.w3.org\\/2000\\/svg\\\" width=\\\"20\\\" height=\\\"20\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.6\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-file-search mt-1 shrink-0 text-gold\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><path d=\\\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\\\"><\\/path><path d=\\\"M4.268 21a2 2 0 0 0 1.727 1H18a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7l-5-5H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v3\\\"><\\/path><path d=\\\"m9 18-1.5-1.5\\\"><\\/path><circle cx=\\\"5\\\" cy=\\\"14\\\" r=\\\"3\\\"><\\/circle><\\/svg><div><h3 class=\\\"font-display text-[19px] font-semibold text-white\\\">Unexplained funds invite questions<\\/h3><p class=\\\"mt-2 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-white\\/70\\\">A balance that appears shortly before an application, without a documented origin, is the most common reason a financial file attracts further enquiry.<\\/p><\\/div><\\/li><li class=\\\"flex gap-5 border-b border-white\\/10 py-7 first:pt-0 last:border-0 last:pb-0\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.w3.org\\/2000\\/svg\\\" width=\\\"20\\\" height=\\\"20\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.6\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-file-search mt-1 shrink-0 text-gold\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><path d=\\\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\\\"><\\/path><path d=\\\"M4.268 21a2 2 0 0 0 1.727 1H18a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7l-5-5H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v3\\\"><\\/path><path d=\\\"m9 18-1.5-1.5\\\"><\\/path><circle cx=\\\"5\\\" cy=\\\"14\\\" r=\\\"3\\\"><\\/circle><\\/svg><div><h3 class=\\\"font-display text-[19px] font-semibold text-white\\\">Inconsistency undermines credibility<\\/h3><p class=\\\"mt-2 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-white\\/70\\\">A name spelled two ways, a figure that does not reconcile, or a certificate dated outside the acceptable window can weaken an otherwise strong file.<\\/p><\\/div><\\/li><li class=\\\"flex gap-5 border-b border-white\\/10 py-7 first:pt-0 last:border-0 last:pb-0\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.w3.org\\/2000\\/svg\\\" width=\\\"20\\\" height=\\\"20\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.6\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-file-search mt-1 shrink-0 text-gold\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><path d=\\\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\\\"><\\/path><path d=\\\"M4.268 21a2 2 0 0 0 1.727 1H18a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7l-5-5H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v3\\\"><\\/path><path d=\\\"m9 18-1.5-1.5\\\"><\\/path><circle cx=\\\"5\\\" cy=\\\"14\\\" r=\\\"3\\\"><\\/circle><\\/svg><div><h3 class=\\\"font-display text-[19px] font-semibold text-white\\\">Timing cannot be recovered<\\/h3><p class=\\\"mt-2 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-white\\/70\\\">Maturity periods, transaction history and filing records accumulate over months. They cannot be assembled in the final weeks before a deadline.<\\/p><\\/div><\\/li><\\/ul><\\/div><\\/div><\\/section> Section Section Label: Why it matters Section Title: Why proper financial documentation matters Section Description: Applications are rarely refused because a family cannot afford the course. They are questioned because the paperwork does not explain the money clearly. Header Button Button Text: Start with an assessment Button URL: \\/contact Card Instance 1 Title: Unexplained funds invite questions Description: A balance that appears shortly before an application, without a documented origin, is the most common reason a financial file attracts further enquiry. Icon: file-search Instance 2 Title: Inconsistency undermines credibility Description: A name spelled two ways, a figure that does not reconcile, or a certificate dated outside the acceptable window can weaken an otherwise strong file. Icon: file-search Instance 3 Title: Timing cannot be recovered Description: Maturity periods, transaction history and filing records accumulate over months. They cannot be assembled in the final weeks before a deadline. Icon: file-search <section class=\\\"bg-white py-16 sm:py-24\\\"><div class=\\\"mx-auto w-full max-w-content px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 xl:px-12\\\"><div class=\\\"grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16\\\"><div class=\\\"lg:col-span-4\\\"><div class=\\\"max-w-2xl\\\"><p class=\\\"mb-3 text-[13px] font-semibold text-brand-blue\\\">Before you enquire<\\/p><h2 class=\\\"text-balance font-display font-bold text-[29px] sm:text-[38px] lg:text-[42px] text-navy-deep\\\">What to expect when you contact us<\\/h2><\\/div><div class=\\\"mt-7 rounded-xl border border-line bg-canvas p-6\\\"><p class=\\\"font-display text-[16px] font-semibold text-navy-deep\\\">Still have a question?<\\/p><p class=\\\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted\\\">Every family\'s financial position is different. A short consultation is usually faster than searching for an answer.<\\/p><a class=\\\"inline-flex min-w-0 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg text-center font-medium transition-[background-color,color,border-color,box-shadow,transform] duration-200 ease-out focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-brand-blue disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-60 border border-line bg-white text-navy hover:border-brand-blue hover:text-brand-blue min-h-10 px-4 py-2 text-sm mt-5\\\" href=\\\"\\/contact\\\">Ask a consultant<\\/a><\\/div><\\/div><div class=\\\"lg:col-span-8\\\"><div class=\\\"divide-y divide-line rounded-xl border border-line bg-white\\\"><div><h3><button id=\\\"contact-faq-button-0\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"contact-faq-panel-0\\\" class=\\\"flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-6 px-5 py-5 text-left transition-colors duration-200 ease-out hover:bg-canvas sm:px-7\\\"><span class=\\\"font-display text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-navy-deep\\\">Is the first consultation chargeable?<\\/span><span class=\\\"mt-0.5 flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-colors duration-200 ease-out border-line text-brand-blue\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.w3.org\\/2000\\/svg\\\" width=\\\"15\\\" height=\\\"15\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-plus\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><path d=\\\"M5 12h14\\\"><\\/path><path d=\\\"M12 5v14\\\"><\\/path><\\/svg><\\/span><\\/button><\\/h3><div id=\\\"contact-faq-panel-0\\\" role=\\\"region\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"contact-faq-button-0\\\" class=\\\"px-5 pb-6 pr-12 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-muted sm:px-7\\\" hidden=\\\"\\\">The first 30-minute consultation is complimentary. It is used to understand your situation and explain which services apply. Fees for any engagement are agreed in writing before work begins.<\\/div><\\/div><div><h3><button id=\\\"contact-faq-button-1\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"contact-faq-panel-1\\\" class=\\\"flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-6 px-5 py-5 text-left transition-colors duration-200 ease-out hover:bg-canvas sm:px-7\\\"><span class=\\\"font-display text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-navy-deep\\\">Can sponsors join the consultation remotely?<\\/span><span class=\\\"mt-0.5 flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-colors duration-200 ease-out border-line text-brand-blue\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.w3.org\\/2000\\/svg\\\" width=\\\"15\\\" height=\\\"15\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-plus\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><path d=\\\"M5 12h14\\\"><\\/path><path d=\\\"M12 5v14\\\"><\\/path><\\/svg><\\/span><\\/button><\\/h3><div id=\\\"contact-faq-panel-1\\\" role=\\\"region\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"contact-faq-button-1\\\" class=\\\"px-5 pb-6 pr-12 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-muted sm:px-7\\\" hidden=\\\"\\\">Yes. Sponsors frequently join by video or phone, including sponsors living abroad. We can hold the consultation in Bangla or English.<\\/div><\\/div><div><h3><button id=\\\"contact-faq-button-2\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"contact-faq-panel-2\\\" class=\\\"flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-6 px-5 py-5 text-left transition-colors duration-200 ease-out hover:bg-canvas sm:px-7\\\"><span class=\\\"font-display text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-navy-deep\\\">How do we send documents securely?<\\/span><span class=\\\"mt-0.5 flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-colors duration-200 ease-out border-line text-brand-blue\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.w3.org\\/2000\\/svg\\\" width=\\\"15\\\" height=\\\"15\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-plus\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><path d=\\\"M5 12h14\\\"><\\/path><path d=\\\"M12 5v14\\\"><\\/path><\\/svg><\\/span><\\/button><\\/h3><div id=\\\"contact-faq-panel-2\\\" role=\\\"region\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"contact-faq-button-2\\\" class=\\\"px-5 pb-6 pr-12 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-muted sm:px-7\\\" hidden=\\\"\\\">After the consultation you receive a document checklist and a secure upload link. Sensitive originals are only requested when they are genuinely required, and are returned to you.<\\/div><\\/div><div><h3><button id=\\\"contact-faq-button-3\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" aria-controls=\\\"contact-faq-panel-3\\\" class=\\\"flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-6 px-5 py-5 text-left transition-colors duration-200 ease-out hover:bg-canvas sm:px-7\\\"><span class=\\\"font-display text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug text-navy-deep\\\">How quickly can work start?<\\/span><span class=\\\"mt-0.5 flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-colors duration-200 ease-out border-line text-brand-blue\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.w3.org\\/2000\\/svg\\\" width=\\\"15\\\" height=\\\"15\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-plus\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><path d=\\\"M5 12h14\\\"><\\/path><path d=\\\"M12 5v14\\\"><\\/path><\\/svg><\\/span><\\/button><\\/h3><div id=\\\"contact-faq-panel-3\\\" role=\\\"region\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"contact-faq-button-3\\\" hidden=\\\"\\\" class=\\\"px-5 pb-6 pr-12 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-muted sm:px-7\\\">Most engagements begin within two to three working days of the consultation, once the scope is agreed. Urgent reviews can often be accommodated \\u2014 tell us your deadline when you enquire.<\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div><\\/section> Section\",\"is_multiple\":false},\"2\":{\"name\":\"Contact Card\",\"is_multiple\":false},\"3\":{\"name\":\"FAQ\",\"is_multiple\":true}},\"created_at\":\"2026-10-07T12:17:00.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-07T12:17:00.000000Z\"}}', NULL, '2026-10-07 12:17:01', '2026-10-07 12:17:01'),
