(2901, 38, 'Section Label', 'text', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 'Who we are', '2', 1, 1, 0, 1, 6, NULL, '2026-10-07 06:01:36', '2026-10-07 06:01:36'),
(2902, 38, 'Section Title', 'text', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 'Professional standards applied to personal circumstances', '2', 1, 1, 1, 1, 6, NULL, '2026-10-07 06:01:37', '2026-10-07 06:01:37'),
(2903, 38, 'Paragraph', 'text', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 'Families preparing to send a student abroad are usually asked, for the first time in their lives, to present their finances in a formal, verifiable structure. Bank balances must be explained. Income must reconcile with filed returns. Assets must be valued and evidenced. Most families have the means; what they lack is the documentation discipline.', '2', 2, 1, 2, 1, 6, NULL, '2026-10-07 06:01:37', '2026-10-07 06:01:37'),
(2904, 38, 'Paragraph', 'text', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 'Mashiat International exists to provide that discipline. Our consultants come from audit, banking, taxation and corporate compliance backgrounds, and apply the same standards of evidence to a sponsor\'s net worth statement as they would to a set of statutory accounts.', '2', 2, 2, 3, 1, 6, NULL, '2026-10-07 06:01:37', '2026-10-07 06:01:37'),
(2905, 38, 'Paragraph', 'text', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 'Alongside our student visa work, the firm serves businesses and individuals across Bangladesh with tax and VAT consultancy, accounting, company incorporation, RJSC filings, licensing, valuation and legal support.', '2', 2, 3, 4, 1, 6, NULL, '2026-10-07 06:01:37', '2026-10-07 06:01:37'),
