(3096, 2, 'Paragraph', 'text', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 'Our consultants come from audit, banking, taxation and corporate compliance backgrounds. That means a net worth statement is built from evidence, a sponsor\'s income is reconciled against filed returns, and every figure in a file can be traced to a document behind it.', '2', 3, 2, 3, 1, 6, NULL, '2026-10-07 13:08:11', '2026-10-07 13:08:11'),
