(3636, 43, 'Description', 'text', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 'Before any document is prepared, we assess where a student and sponsor actually stand. We review available funds, income sources, assets and the timing of transactions, then map them against the published financial evidence requirements of the destination country and institution. The outcome is a written assessment that tells you what is already strong, what is missing, and what needs time to mature.', '2', 2, 1, 6, 0, 6, NULL, '2026-10-08 08:49:24', '2026-10-08 08:49:24'),
