(3664, 43, 'Question', 'text', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 'How early should the assessment be done?', '2', 11, 1, 34, 0, 6, NULL, '2026-10-08 08:49:24', '2026-10-08 08:56:43'),
(3665, 43, 'Answer', 'text', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 'Ideally six to nine months before your intended intake. Fund maturity periods and transaction history cannot be created retrospectively, so early assessment gives you time to organise your position properly.', '2', 11, 1, 35, 0, 6, NULL, '2026-10-08 08:49:24', '2026-10-08 08:56:43'),
(3666, 43, 'Question', 'text', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 'Does the assessment guarantee a particular outcome?', '2', 11, 2, 36, 0, 6, NULL, '2026-10-08 08:49:24', '2026-10-08 08:56:43'),
(3667, 43, 'Answer', 'text', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 'No. Visa decisions rest entirely with the relevant immigration authority. Our role is to help you prepare accurate, complete and well-organised financial documentation.', '2', 11, 2, 37, 0, 6, NULL, '2026-10-08 08:49:24', '2026-10-08 08:56:44'),
(3668, 43, 'Question', 'text', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 'Can you assess more than one sponsor?', '2', 11, 3, 38, 0, 6, NULL, '2026-10-08 08:49:24', '2026-10-08 08:56:44'),
(3669, 43, 'Answer', 'text', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 'Yes. Multiple sponsors are common. We review each sponsor separately and then assess the combined position and how the sponsorship should be structured and evidenced.', '2', 11, 3, 39, 0, 6, NULL, '2026-10-08 08:49:24', '2026-10-08 08:56:44'),
