(3676, 43, 'Description', 'text', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 'Source of funds is the area where applications most often attract further questions. We help sponsors document their relationship to the student, their income and occupation, and the origin of the funds shown in the application ??? building an evidence trail that is internally consistent and supported by third-party records.', '3', 2, 1, 6, 0, 6, NULL, '2026-10-08 08:50:09', '2026-10-08 08:50:09'),
